      "claim": "In humans, blonanserin, a methoxy-substituted aromatic CNS agent, showed a brain/plasma concentration ratio of 3.38 by PET, indicating good blood-brain barrier permeability and supporting meaningful CNS access for similar methoxy/heteroaromatic structures.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
